        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia makumi asatu ne tshisambombo tshia mu bukelenge bua Asa, Bâsha, mukelenge wa Isalele, wakaya kuluangana ne Bena Yuda; yeye wakasa Lama bua yeye ahidishe bantu bua kabahatuki ne kabahinganyi kudi Asa, mukelenge wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Asa wakangata argent ne or bia mu bibutshilu bia mu nsubu wa Yehowa ne mu nsubu wa mukelenge, wakabitumina kudi Bene-hadada, mukelenge wa Sulia, wakadi ushikama mu Damaseke, ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshihungidi tshidi hankatshi hetu bu muakaditshi hankatshi ha tatu wanyi ne tatu webe; mona, nakakutumina argent ne or; ya biebe, ushihe tshihungidi tshiwakahunga ne Bâsha, mukelenge wa Isalele, bua yeye Umuke kundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene-hadada wakitabusha dî dia mukelenge Asa, wakatuma tupitene tua masalayi andi bua kuluangana ne bena misoko ya mu Isalele; bakahaula Iyona ne Dana ne Abele-maima ne misoko ya bibutshilu bia mu Nafatale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua Bâsha lumu elu, yeye wakalekela kuasa Lama; mudimu wakashika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mukelenge Asa wakaya ne Bena Yuda, bakangata mabue ne mitshi biakadi ku Lama biakadi Bâsha wasa nʼabi; bobo bakasa nʼabi Geba ne Misepa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshikondo atshi Hanani, mumonyi wa malu, wakalua kudi Asa, mukelenge wa Yuda, wakamuambila ne, Bualu bua wewe wakueyemena mukelenge wa Sulia, kuakueyemena Yehowa Nzambi webe, nunku bantu ba mukelenge wa Sulia bakahanduka mu bianza biebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Atiopa ne Bena Lubima kabakadi tshisumbu tshinene ne makalu ne bena tubalu bia bungi, anyi? Kadi bualu bua wewe wakueyemena Yehowa, yeye wakabafila mu bianza biebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua mesu a Yehowa adi akenzekana ku nseke yonso ya buloba bua kulesha bakole buandi kudi bantu badi ne mitshima miakane kudiye. Wewe wakuenza buhote mu bualu ebu, kubangila mu dituku edi wewe newikale ne nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha diba adi Asa wakadi ne mumonyi wa malu tshiji, wakamubuesha mu nsubu wa lukanu; bualu bua tshiji tshikole tshiakamukuata bua bualu ebu. Asa wakakengesha bantu bakuabo mu tshikondo atshi tshiotshimue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monai, bienzedi bia Asa bia kumudilu ne bia kunshikidilu bidi bifunda mu mukanda wa bakelenge ba Yuda ne Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia makumi asatu ne tshitema tshia bukelenge buandi disama diakakuata Asa ku makasa andi; disama edi diakadi dikole; kadi mu disama diandi yeye kakakeba Yehowa, kadi wakakeba bangangabuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi, wakafua mu tshidimu tshia makumi anai ne tshimue tshia bukelenge buandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamujika mu lukita luakadiumbuileye mu musoko wa Davidi; bakamuladika ha bulalu buakadi ne bintu bia bungi bia muhuya muimpe biakalongololabo kudi bantu ba lungenyi lule; bakamuelela bintu bia bungi mu madilu andi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
